      "source_quote": "義軍既迫，不復得西，乃還家。",
      "reading": "因義軍迫近不能西去，遂還家。",
      "note": "因義軍迫近不能西去，遂還家。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 146,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence3-146",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖素聞藩直言於殷氏，又為玄盡節，召為員外散騎侍郎，參鎮軍軍事。",
      "reading": "劉裕聞其直言於殷仲堪及為桓玄盡節，召參鎮軍。",
      "note": "劉裕聞其直言於殷仲堪及為桓玄盡節，召參鎮軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 146,
      "end_codepoint": 178,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "從征鮮卑，賊屯聚臨朐，藩言於高祖曰：「賊屯軍城外，留守必寡，今往取其城，而斬其旗幟，此韓信所以克趙也。」",
      "reading": "征南燕臨朐，胡藩以韓信克趙往事進言。",
      "note": "征南燕臨朐，胡藩以韓信克趙往事進言。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 52,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-52",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖乃遣檀韶與藩等潛往，既至，即克其城。",
      "reading": "劉裕用檀韶與胡藩等取城。",
      "note": "劉裕用檀韶與胡藩等取城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 52,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-72",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "賊見城陷，一時奔走，還保廣固累月。",
      "reading": "敵退守廣固數月。",
      "note": "敵退守廣固數月。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 72,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-89",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "將拔之夜，佐史並集，忽有鳥大如鵝，蒼黑色，飛入高祖帳裏，眾皆駭愕，以為不祥。",
      "reading": "拔城前夜，記鳥入劉裕帳眾人駭異。",
      "note": "拔城前夜，記鳥入劉裕帳眾人駭異。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 89,
      "end_codepoint": 127,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-127",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "藩起賀曰：「蒼黑者，胡虜之色，胡虜歸我，大吉之祥也。」",
      "reading": "胡藩以蒼黑色解作敵人歸附的吉祥。",
      "note": "胡藩以蒼黑色解作敵人歸附的吉祥。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 127,
      "end_codepoint": 154,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-154",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "明旦，攻城，陷之。",
      "reading": "翌晨城陷。",
      "note": "翌晨城陷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 154,
      "end_codepoint": 163,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-163",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "從討盧循於左里，頻戰有功，封吳平縣五等子，除正員郎。",
      "reading": "左里討盧循有功，封吳平縣五等子、除正員郎。",
      "note": "左里討盧循有功，封吳平縣五等子、除正員郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 163,
      "end_codepoint": 189,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence4-189",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "尋轉寧遠將軍、鄱陽太守。",
      "reading": "轉寧遠將軍、鄱陽太守。",
      "note": "轉寧遠將軍、鄱陽太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 189,
      "end_codepoint": 201,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "從伐劉毅。",
      "reading": "從討劉毅。",
      "note": "從討劉毅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 5,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-5",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "毅初當之荊州，表求東道還京辭墓，去都數十里，不過拜闕。",
      "reading": "追敘劉毅赴荊州前請還京辭墓。",
      "note": "追敘劉毅赴荊州前請還京辭墓。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 5,
      "end_codepoint": 32,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-32",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖出倪塘會之。",
      "reading": "劉裕出倪塘會見劉毅。",
      "note": "劉裕出倪塘會見劉毅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 32,
      "end_codepoint": 40,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-40",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "藩勸於坐殺毅，高祖不從。",
      "reading": "胡藩勸席間殺毅，劉裕未從。",
      "note": "胡藩勸席間殺毅，劉裕未從。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 40,
      "end_codepoint": 52,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-52",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "至是謂藩曰：「昔從卿倪塘之謀，無今舉也。」",
      "reading": "此時劉裕回顧早先倪塘之謀。",
      "note": "此時劉裕回顧早先倪塘之謀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 52,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "又從征司馬休之，復為參軍，加建武將軍，領游軍於江津。",
      "reading": "討司馬休之，胡藩加建武將軍，在江津領軍。",
      "note": "討司馬休之，胡藩加建武將軍，在江津領軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "徐逵之敗沒，高祖怒甚，即日於馬頭岸渡江，而江津岸峭，壁立數丈，休之臨岸置陣，無由可登。",
      "reading": "徐逵之敗沒，劉裕欲渡江，司馬休之守岸。",
      "note": "徐逵之敗沒，劉裕欲渡江，司馬休之守岸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 142,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-142",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖呼藩令上，藩有疑色，高祖奮怒，命左右錄來，欲斬之。",
      "reading": "劉裕令藩先登，見其遲疑欲殺之。",
      "note": "劉裕令藩先登，見其遲疑欲殺之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 142,
      "end_codepoint": 169,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-169",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "藩不受命，顧曰：「藩寧前死耳！」",
      "reading": "胡藩表明願死於前。",
      "note": "胡藩表明願死於前。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 169,
      "end_codepoint": 185,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-185",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "以刀頭穿岸，劣容脚指，於是徑上，隨之者稍多。",
      "reading": "胡藩登上江岸，後續者漸多。",
      "note": "胡藩登上江岸，後續者漸多。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 185,
      "end_codepoint": 207,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-207",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "既得登岸，殊死戰，賊不能當，引退。",
      "reading": "登岸後戰，敵退。",
      "note": "登岸後戰，敵退。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 207,
      "end_codepoint": 224,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence5-224",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "因而乘之，一時奔散。",
      "reading": "乘勢而敵潰。",
      "note": "乘勢而敵潰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 224,
      "end_codepoint": 234,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖伐羌，假藩寧朔將軍，參太尉軍事，統別軍。",
      "reading": "討後秦，劉裕假藩寧朔將軍。",
      "note": "討後秦，劉裕假藩寧朔將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-22",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "至河東，暴風漂藩重艦渡北岸，索虜牽得此艦，取其器物。",
      "reading": "河東遇風失船。",
      "note": "河東遇風失船。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-48",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "藩氣厲心憤，率左右十二人，乘小船逕往河北。",
      "reading": "胡藩與隨從十二人往河北。",
      "note": "胡藩與隨從十二人往河北。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-69",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "賊騎五六百見藩來，並笑之。",
      "reading": "對岸有五六百騎。",
      "note": "對岸有五六百騎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 82,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-82",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "藩素善射，登岸射，賊應弦而倒者十許人，賊皆奔退，悉收所失而反。",
      "reading": "胡藩取回船上所失。",
      "note": "胡藩取回船上所失。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 82,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-113",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "又遣藩及朱超石等追索虜於半城，虜騎數重，藩及超石所領皆割配新軍，不盈五千，率厲力戰，大破之。",
      "reading": "胡藩與朱超石等在半城擊敵。",
      "note": "胡藩與朱超石等在半城擊敵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 113,
      "end_codepoint": 159,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence6-159",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "又與超石等擊姚業於蒲坂，超石失利退還，藩收超石所捨資實，徐行而反，業不敢追。",
      "reading": "蒲坂失利，胡藩收朱超石所棄資物，姚業未追。",
      "note": "蒲坂失利，胡藩收朱超石所棄資物，姚業未追。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 159,
      "end_codepoint": 197,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "高祖還彭城，參相國軍事。",
      "reading": "劉裕還彭城，胡藩參相國軍事。",
      "note": "劉裕還彭城，胡藩參相國軍事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 12,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-12",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "時盧循餘黨與蘇淫賊大相聚結，以為始興相。",
      "reading": "因始興有盧循餘黨等聚結，任始興相。",
      "note": "因始興有盧循餘黨等聚結，任始興相。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 12,
      "end_codepoint": 32,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-32",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "論平司馬休之及廣固功，封陽山縣男，食邑五百戶。",
      "reading": "以司馬休之及廣固功，封陽山縣男、邑五百戶。",
      "note": "以司馬休之及廣固功，封陽山縣男、邑五百戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 32,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "少帝景平元年，坐守東府，開掖門，免官，尋復其職。",
      "reading": "景平元年，以守東府開掖門免官，旋復職。",
      "note": "景平元年，以守東府開掖門免官，旋復職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 79,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-79",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "元嘉四年，遷建武將軍、江夏內史。",
      "reading": "元嘉四年任建武將軍、江夏內史。",
      "note": "元嘉四年任建武將軍、江夏內史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 79,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-95",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
      "source_quote": "七年，徵為游擊將軍。",
      "reading": "七年徵游擊將軍。",
      "note": "七年徵游擊將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 95,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-hufan:received_sentence7-105",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "otw_1ui_wba",
